        "subject": "LU-21236 obdclass: use OBD macros for DIO page arrays",
        "message": "LU-21236 obdclass: use OBD macros for DIO page arrays\n\nAllocate and free the DIO page number array, and the folio\narray of the unaligned DIO bounce buffer, with the OBD\nmacros, so they are counted in Lustre memory use. Record\nthe page number array size, since the aligned path\nallocates it before it knows the page count.\n\nThe user page array stays on kvfree(), since the kernel\nallocates it.\n\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I27e8292d6e20afeebf7692cc1d7f9766cb52b76b\n"
      },
